[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 8160.95, "timestamp": "02:16:00", "text": "目前的日程安排相当混乱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8163.35, "timestamp": "02:16:03", "text": "你好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8167.03, "timestamp": "02:16:07", "text": "所以，感觉就像昨天我……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8169.75, "timestamp": "02:16:09", "text": "就像和朋友们闲聊一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8175.75, "timestamp": "02:16:15", "text": "一切都结束了，当时大概是下午3点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8179.189, "timestamp": "02:16:19", "text": "凌晨3点。哦，是的。我们当时只是在闲聊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8183.35, "timestamp": "02:16:23", "text": "关于尴尬的时刻，关于我们的过去。我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8186.55, "timestamp": "02:16:26", "text": "我们在回忆过去的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8189.51, "timestamp": "02:16:29", "text": "这样做令人不快。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8191.75, "timestamp": "02:16:31", "text": "嗯，然后我就又睡着了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8194.95, "timestamp": "02:16:34", "text": "4点。我应该把它修好。并非我对此感到不满。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8196.91, "timestamp": "02:16:36", "text": "旋转。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8198.79, "timestamp": "02:16:38", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8200.309, "timestamp": "02:16:40", "text": "那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8202.469, "timestamp": "02:16:42", "text": "是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8206.629, "timestamp": "02:16:46", "text": "我想我早上七八点就睡了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8209.03, "timestamp": "02:16:49", "text": "我10岁的时候就不得不去，就像我必须去一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8213.669, "timestamp": "02:16:53", "text": "今天学院也开课了。所以，大概在11点或10点。所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8218.469, "timestamp": "02:16:58", "text": "我几乎没睡着。哦，去睡觉吧。去"}]